{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3uxp1KeJdXCoMqPR87","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small surrender.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold firm. The deadbolt slides home — a tongue of steel finding its groove in the frame.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there.\nBetween known and unknown.\nBetween safe and unsafe — though you never can be sure which side is which.\n\nPress your palm flat against me. Feel the cold. Feel the hum of everything I'm keeping apart.\n\n**I am locked.**\n\nWhat would you have of me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}